# Frontend env

Use the **repository root** `.env`. Next reads `API_URL` from there when started via
`make frontend-dev` / `make local-dev`.

`API_URL` must point at the Go `/v1` prefix, e.g. `http://127.0.0.1:8080/v1`
(or a host-only URL — the BFF appends `/v1` if missing).

Do not put secrets in `NEXT_PUBLIC_*`.
